---
layout: base.njk
title: Projects
permalink: /projects/
description: Personal projects, work projects, and earlier data visualization work by Steve McMurtry.
---
<h1>Projects</h1>

<section>
  <h2>Personal</h2>
  {% set items = projects.personal %}{% include "project-list.njk" %}
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Work</h2>
  {% set items = projects.work %}{% include "project-list.njk" %}
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Earlier work</h2>
  <p class="section-note">Data visualizations from 2015 and 2016, when I worked as a freelance data science and data visualization specialist.</p>
  <ul class="archive-grid">
    {%- for p in projects.archive %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ p.url }}">
        <img src="/img/{{ p.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="900" height="650">
        <span class="title">{{ p.title }}</span>
        <span class="year">{{ p.date | year }}</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
